  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This serves 4 and takes about 1 hour 5 minutes. The thing to watch is the chilli: the heat in this soup should be present but not overwhelming. Use a whole scotch bonnet added to the pot without breaking it if you want flavour with less fire, or blend it in for full heat."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Do not add thickeners or starch to this soup. It is called light soup because the broth is clear and thin. The flavour comes from the quality of the stock and the careful seasoning, not from body."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
